Break:
Terminates the loop.

Continue:
Skips the current iteration.

Pass:
A null statement used as a placeholder.

Nested loop:
A loop inside another loop.

Iterable:
An object that can be iterated over.

Iterator:
An object that returns elements one at a time.

Counter:
A variable used to count occurrences.

Accumulator:
A variable used to accumulate a result.

